  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet or wok over medium-high heat",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant",
    "Add the sirloin steak tips and cook for 3-4 minutes, until browned",
    "Add the bell peppers and onions and cook for 2-3 minutes, until tender",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the calamansi juice and soy sauce",
    "Pour the sauce over the steak and vegetables, and stir to combine",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste",
    "Cook for an additional 1-2 minutes, until the sauce has thickened",
    "Serve the stir-fry hot, garnished with sliced green onions and served in a Korean brass bowl"
  ],
